; HIGHER-ORDER: variable in FUNCTOR position. Every trie-join classifier requires a
; Symbol head, so this is guaranteed to fall through to the coreferential DFS in both
; engines. $h is bound by the NewVar SIZES loop at functor depth, then back-referenced
; in factor 2.
(p 5)
(q 5)
(zz 6)
(rel p)
(rel zz)
(exec 0 (, ($h 5) (rel $h)) (, (out $h)))
